% n25_num_no_numtype -- a numeral with NOTHING NOMINATED has no type and is
% refused (kernel 32). The alternative, a built-in default type, would let a
% file state a theorem about numerals it never declared a home for.
% Note there is deliberately NO `numtype` line here.
0 sort 0
axiom I64 : 0
1 const I64
2 sort 0
3 pi 1 2
axiom P : 3
4 const P
5 num 7
6 app 4 5
7 sort 0
check 6 : 7
